  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive) <strong>•</strong> <strong>I</strong>nstall: Clinic</p>\n<p><strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 3 (1d6)</p>\n<p><em>Adds biomechanical sound-absorbing soles to the bottom of the feet.</em></p>\n<p>Cyberleg Option. Requires two Cyberlegs, takes 2 Option Slots, and must be paired. The user gains a +2 bonus to Stealth Checks involving making as little noise as possible when moving. If the user has only used half of their MOVE (Round Up) and hasn’t taken the Run Action on a Turn they make a Stealth Check in, they instead gain a +4 bonus.</p>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> Cyberleg<br>\n<strong>Install:</strong> Clinic<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> uses 2</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The effect gives +2 and is situational; add the other +2 in the roll dialog when the movement condition is met.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberlegs).</em></p>"
